{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06KS", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$U$", "MATH_0002": "$R$", "MATH_0003": "$[U/R]$", "MATH_0004": "$[U/R]$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-smooth-RS-groupoid-in-functors-quotient}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c6d5f58d2f64840fde8ebbf90deaed990ea8fbd325035b7b041133184e749354", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fdf873b243b1b25c0ee68807687dbe945363e14c7ef7de07bf10c6dd9538dd6f", "source_text": "Since <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> are deformation functors <MATH_0003> is a predeformation\ncategory. Since (RS) holds for deformation functors by\ndefinition we see that (RS) holds for [U/R] by\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nHence <MATH_0004> is a deformation category. Statements (2) and (3)\nfollow directly from the definitions.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5638733d6142a916237eea646d90d5d3999ee73d1b1eea63797a13457d30a9de", "unit_id": "tag:06KU:proof"}
